800e49012f220500a65fd14b4fc1935ba6f8af9c3914aa96095aded5b13dbb88  EHTLE-agent-handoff-v0.6.zip

Built from the commit that contains this file. Reproduce with:
  python3 scripts/build_release.py --output ../EHTLE-agent-handoff-v0.6.zip
The build is deterministic: fixed timestamps and a sorted manifest, so a clean rebuild from
the same commit yields the same digest. This file is not shipped in the archive, because a
file inside the archive cannot record that archive's own digest.
